Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">亏千亿也要敲钟：Anthropic 创纪录 IPO 背后的算力账单</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI向ChatGPT Plus及Business用户开放dots智能助理测试</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Google正式开放Genie4世界模型API，支持实时交互与原生音频生成</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌发布AI智能体优化研究：通过直接修改运行框架代码提升成功率</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3ab5fee05d3a5c9c09aa9954906e4498.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌研究团队于11月17日发布论文，提出通过直接修改AI智能体运行框架（Harness）代码，而非仅优化提示词（Prompt）来提升性能。实验显示，将142行代码拆分为上下文管理、智能体控制、工具调用及验证恢复四个模块，并允许模型逐块优化，可使Gemini 3.8 Flash在SWE-bench Lite任务上的成功率从5%提升至40%。相比整体重写方案，该模块化机制在保持高成功率的同时，将单题平均Token消耗从45.16万大幅降低至4.67万。该方法在迁移至Gemini 4 Argon模型时同样表现优异。团队强调，赋予智能体代码修改权限需配合严格的验证机制与权限边界，以防止提示词膨胀或过度优化。此研究证明将核心约束写入代码而非提示词，是提升智能体执行效率与稳定性的有效路径。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯混元Hy4大模型正式全量开源，支持百万上下文并采用MoE架构</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/251646a3fd79fbdf3d24a2b3fcafa612.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">11月20日，腾讯混元团队正式开源Hy4大模型，相关权重已在GitHub、Hugging Face、ModelScope及GitCode上线，标志着混元LLM系列实现全量开源。Hy4采用MoE混合专家架构，总参数量770B，激活参数49B，支持100万Token上下文窗口。同步开源的还有主打高性价比的Hy4flash模型，其总参数量224B，激活参数12B，支持多模态输入与100万Token上下文。两款模型均采用Apache 2.0协议，允许商业使用与修改。腾讯同步发布了Hy4安全评估卡片，明确训练数据剔除了漏洞利用等攻击性内容，并经腾讯玄武与科恩实验室审计，未发现进攻性能力风险。此次开源覆盖了从旗舰版到高性价比版的完整产品线，为开发者提供了更灵活的部署选择。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">亏千亿也要敲钟：Anthropic 创纪录 IPO 背后的算力账单</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b0a5de56a69418894ab836e18b192464.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">亏千亿也要敲钟：Anthropic 创纪录 IPO 背后的算力账单AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Nov 20, 20261711 月 19 日，成立不到六年的 Anthropic 登陆纳斯达克（代码 ANT），募资约 813 亿美元，创史上最大 IPO 纪录。发行价 83 美元，首日收报 97.17 美元、涨 17.07%，市值约 1.28 万亿美元，盘中一度摸到 2 万亿。连同 260 亿美元私募，合计募得约 1073 亿美元。9000 亿算力承诺，压着 810 亿 ARR 招股书里更扎眼的是另一组数字：前九个月净亏损超 1040 亿美元，但其中 943 亿只是负债公允价值变动，并非实际支出，经营亏损实为 12.6 亿。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI向ChatGPT Plus及Business用户开放dots智能助理测试</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9a40695c8f47606013a96c17b4f88324.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">11月20日，OpenAI核心产品负责人宣布，dots智能助理正式开启小范围测试，面向ChatGPT Plus用户及所有Business Standard用户开放。dots的核心差异化在于其内置“云电脑”架构，支持在后台自主执行排议程、构建网站、应用测试及笔记修改等复杂任务，并能通过用户反馈持续优化工作偏好。在权限管理上，用户可逐项设定dots的自主决策边界。同步进行的移动端改版中，dots在底部标签栏获得独立入口，支持将Codex、Projects、Images等功能固定至底部，用户可通过“New ChatGPT Design”开关自由切换新旧界面。此次更新标志着dots从DevDay 2026的演示产品正式迈向实际应用阶段，通过云端自动化能力，将AI助理从对话框扩展至后台工作流。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Google正式开放Genie4世界模型API，支持实时交互与原生音频生成</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/85a834d677cc386765934af65a4ee670.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Google宣布通过Gemini API与Google AI Studio向付费开发者开放Genie4世界模型。该模型依托Gemini Omni视觉渲染与Gemini推理能力，支持从文本或图像生成720p、24fps的连续高清交互世界，并同步输出原生立体声音频。用户可通过WASD或方向键实现约0.5秒延迟的实时移动，并利用文本提示在1至2秒内动态调整环境状态。技术架构上，Genie4基于WebRTC与WebSocket进行流媒体传输，单次会话上限120秒，并嵌入SynthID水印。API定价为每百万输入令牌1.50美元、视频输出17.50美元，综合流媒体成本约每秒0.10美元。此次开放标志着Google DeepMind首个实时世界模型进入第三方应用生态，为交互式原型设计、空间可视化及机器人与AGI智能体训练提</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
